  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">添加一个分析器以查看你的ME网络中正在发生的事情。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组灵感来源于AE2Stuff的网络可视化器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以直观地查看所有ME设备的状态。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1531/128/showoff.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"475\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你还可以拥有自定义显示界面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/789/484/gui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"733\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你还可以对网络进行可视化剖析。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1445/86/showoff_tick.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"672\"></span></p>",
